Third-Party Components — Installer Scripts
==========================================

The installer scripts (install.sh, install.ps1) distributed with the
EdgeFirst Profiler CLI at EdgeFirstAI/profiler-cli are original works
authored by Au-Zone Technologies Inc. They do not incorporate code
from third-party projects. Common patterns (POSIX sh idioms,
PowerShell parameter binding) are not subject to attribution.

Third-Party Components — edgefirst-profiler Binary
===================================================

The edgefirst-profiler binary distributed via EdgeFirstAI/profiler-cli
GitHub Releases bundles third-party libraries. The complete list of
those libraries and their licenses is reported by the binary itself:

    edgefirst-profiler --licenses

A machine-readable copy may also be attached to each release as
NOTICE.binary alongside the platform archives.
